   "isDeleted": false,
   "groupIds": [],
   "boundElements": null,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false
  },
  {
   "id": "jn_30",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 56,
   "y": 604,
   "width": 99,
   "height": 17,
   "strokeColor": "#047857",
   "backgroundColor": "transparent",
   "fillStyle": "solid",
   "strokeWidth": 1,
   "strokeStyle": "solid",
   "roughness": 0,
   "opacity": 100,
   "angle": 0,
   "seed": 100029,
   "version": 1,
   "versionNonce": 700203,
   "isDeleted": false,
   "groupIds": [],
   "boundElements": null,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "determinism",
   "originalText": "determinism",
   "fontSize": 14,
   "fontFamily": 3,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": null,
   "lineHeight": 1.25
  },
  {
   "id": "jd_30",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 56,
   "y": 630,
   "width": 323,
   "height": 60,
   "strokeColor": "#64748b",
   "backgroundColor": "transparent",
   "fillStyle": "solid",
   "strokeWidth": 1,
   "strokeStyle": "solid",
   "roughness": 0,
   "opacity": 100,
   "angle": 0,
   "seed": 100030,
   "version": 1,
   "versionNonce": 700210,
   "isDeleted": false,
   "groupIds": [],
   "boundElements": null,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "Once arrival order is an explicit recorded\nNUMBER rather than an emergent consequence\nof concurrent execution, matching becomes a\nPURE FUNCTION of (book, next order).",
   "originalText": "Once arrival order is an explicit recorded\nNUMBER rather than an emergent consequence\nof concurrent execution, matching becomes a\nPURE FUNCTION of (book, next order).",
   "fontSize": 12,
   "fontFamily": 3,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": null,
   "lineHeight": 1.25
  },
  {
   "id": "j_580",
   "type": "ellipse",
   "x": 580,
   "y": 608,
   "width": 12,
   "height": 12,
   "strokeColor": "#047857",
   "backgroundColor": "#047857",
   "fillStyle": "solid",
   "strokeWidth": 1,
   "strokeStyle": "solid",
   "roughness": 0,
   "opacity": 100,
   "angle": 0,
   "seed": 100031,
   "version": 1,
   "versionNonce": 700217,
   "isDeleted": false,
   "groupIds": [],
   "boundElements": null,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false
  },
  {
   "id": "jn_580",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 606,
   "y": 604,
   "width": 212,
   "height": 17,
   "strokeColor": "#047857",
   "backgroundColor": "transparent",
   "fillStyle": "solid",
   "strokeWidth": 1,
   "strokeStyle": "solid",
   "roughness": 0,
   "opacity": 100,
   "angle": 0,
   "seed": 100032,
   "version": 1,
   "versionNonce": 700224,
   "isDeleted": false,
   "groupIds": [],
   "boundElements": null,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "fairness, made auditable",
   "originalText": "fairness, made auditable",
   "fontSize": 14,
   "fontFamily": 3,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": null,
   "lineHeight": 1.25
  },
  {
   "id": "jd_580",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 606,
   "y": 630,
   "width": 316,
   "height": 60,
   "strokeColor": "#64748b",
   "backgroundColor": "transparent",
   "fillStyle": "solid",
   "strokeWidth": 1,
   "strokeStyle": "solid",
   "roughness": 0,
   "opacity": 100,
   "angle": 0,
   "seed": 100033,
   "version": 1,
   "versionNonce": 700231,
   "isDeleted": false,
   "groupIds": [],
   "boundElements": null,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "Price-time priority is meaningless if you\ncannot say what time an order arrived. The\nsequence IS the arrival time - and it is\nrecorded, so a dispute can be answered.",
   "originalText": "Price-time priority is meaningless if you\ncannot say what time an order arrived. The\nsequence IS the arrival time - and it is\nrecorded, so a dispute can be answered.",
   "fontSize": 12,
   "fontFamily": 3,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": null,
   "lineHeight": 1.25
  },
  {
   "id": "j_1130",
   "type": "ellipse",
   "x": 1130,
   "y": 608,
   "width": 12,
   "height": 12,
   "strokeColor": "#047857",
   "backgroundColor": "#047857",
   "fillStyle": "solid",
   "strokeWidth": 1,
   "strokeStyle": "solid",
   "roughness": 0,
   "opacity": 100,
   "angle": 0,
   "seed": 100034,
   "version": 1,
   "versionNonce": 700238,
   "isDeleted": false,
   "groupIds": [],
   "boundElements": null,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false
  },
  {
   "id": "jn_1130",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 1156,
   "y": 604,
   "width": 299,
   "height": 17,
   "strokeColor": "#047857",
   "backgroundColor": "transparent",
   "fillStyle": "solid",
   "strokeWidth": 1,
   "strokeStyle": "solid",
   "roughness": 0,
   "opacity": 100,
   "angle": 0,
   "seed": 100035,
   "version": 1,
   "versionNonce": 700245,
   "isDeleted": false,
   "groupIds": [],
   "boundElements": null,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "exactly-once, with no transactions",
   "originalText": "exactly-once, with no transactions",
   "fontSize": 14,
   "fontFamily": 3,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": null,
   "lineHeight": 1.25
  },
  {
   "id": "jd_1130",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 1156,
   "y": 630,
   "width": 338,
   "height": 60,
   "strokeColor": "#64748b",
   "backgroundColor": "transparent",
   "fillStyle": "solid",
   "strokeWidth": 1,
   "strokeStyle": "solid",
   "roughness": 0,
   "opacity": 100,
   "angle": 0,
   "seed": 100036,
   "version": 1,
   "versionNonce": 700252,
   "isDeleted": false,
   "groupIds": [],
   "boundElements": null,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "Every event has a unique sequence number, so\na consumer knows precisely what it processed.\nA restarting consumer resumes at its last\nsequence - no duplicates, no dedup table.",
   "originalText": "Every event has a unique sequence number, so\na consumer knows precisely what it processed.\nA restarting consumer resumes at its last\nsequence - no duplicates, no dedup table.",
   "fontSize": 12,
   "fontFamily": 3,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": null,
   "lineHeight": 1.25
  },
  {
   "id": "cn",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 30,
   "y": 712,
   "width": 987,
   "height": 65,
   "strokeColor": "#1e40af",
   "backgroundColor": "transparent",
   "fillStyle": "solid",
   "strokeWidth": 1,
   "strokeStyle": "solid",
   "roughness": 0,
   "opacity": 100,
   "angle": 0,
   "seed": 100037,
   "version": 1,
   "versionNonce": 700259,
   "isDeleted": false,
   "groupIds": [],
   "boundElements": null,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "Why not Kafka, given it is exactly this concept: a produce-and-acknowledge is 1-10 ms - THREE ORDERS OF MAGNITUDE over the\nbudget. So the design keeps Kafka's semantics (an ordered, replayable log) and reimplements them at the right speed: a\nSINGLE-WRITER append into /dev/shm. Being able to say 'Kafka is conceptually correct and 1000x too slow' beats either\nusing it or dismissing it. And single-writer is what makes it fast AND correct: no lock, no CAS, no ordering ambiguity.",
   "originalText": "Why not Kafka, given it is exactly this concept: a produce-and-acknowledge is 1-10 ms - THREE ORDERS OF MAGNITUDE over the\nbudget. So the design keeps Kafka's semantics (an ordered, replayable log) and reimplements them at the right speed: a\nSINGLE-WRITER append into /dev/shm. Being able to say 'Kafka is conceptually correct and 1000x too slow' beats either\nusing it or dismissing it. And single-writer is what makes it fast AND correct: no lock, no CAS, no ordering ambiguity.",
   "fontSize": 13,
   "fontFamily": 3,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": null,
   "lineHeight": 1.25
  },
  {
   "id": "d3",
   "type": "line",
   "x": 30,
   "y": 812,
   "width": 1670,
   "height": 0,
   "strokeColor": "#cbd5e1",
